{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32853","headline":"陕州题河上亭 · 李频","name":"陕州题河上亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"岸拥洪流急，亭开清兴长。\n当轩河草晚，入坐水风凉。\n独鸟惊来客，孤云触去樯。\n秋声和远雨，暮色带微阳。\n浪静澄牕影，沙阴发簟光。\n逍遥每尽日，谁识爱沧浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李频","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32853.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32853","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}